<title>The derivative of the natural logarithm</title>

<p><ref>Video</ref> | <ref>Summary</ref> | <ref>Transcript</ref>  </p>
<description>
Determining the derivative of the natural logarithm from the fact that it is the inverse of the exponential function.
</description>

